 "description": "Compare two to ten ETFs using their latest stored holdings. Returns pairwise shared holdings, weighted overlap (sum of the smaller weight for each shared holding), each fund's weight in shared names, and the largest duplicate exposures. Coverage is explicit because provider holdings may be partial top-holdings samples. Read-only. Successful results include an optional platformLink for continuing this research or reviewing the exact saved draft in Bullrun. When useful, present its descriptive link and respect its description of any settings not carried over.",
